[?2004l[?2004h> # Question 8: What safety risks are listed for Paxlovid?
[?2004l[?2004h> # qid: 2d63e0a82215867f, Paxlovid, set_id: 8a99d6d6-fd9e-45bb-b1bf-48c7f761232a
